61198385699865", "personaname": "Sharmoota#1", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/vinypapalardo/", "num_games_owned": 7, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 38, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 30, "last_played": 1503517915, "avatar": "26c61fed7d23390f0b104d9199462817a62f7ad3"}, "language": "english", "review": "my game is total and utter ♥♥♥♥. it keeps sayuonf thsat my graphices card is sitballs\n", "timestamp_created": 1503518070, "timestamp_updated": 1503518070, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.384690284729003906", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "34445374", "author": {"steamid": "76561198184242954", "personaname": "Teapot Error 418", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198184242954/", "num_games_owned": 279, "num_reviews": 69, "playtime_forever": 63845, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 637, "last_played": 1768000414, "avatar": "99ad078375173c5a194c0cc85be969f3c06cef57"}, "language": "english", "review": "Amazing game", "timestamp_created": 1503517304, "timestamp_updated": 1651267128, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.483383685350418091", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "34444509", "author": {"steamid": "76561198022466111", "personaname": "Leap", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/LeapMaster/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 77085, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 57468, "last_played": 1788155331, "avatar": "5b239a2bab2c69359c603410dae89c999d088e9e"}, "language": "english", "review": "+ Gorgeous, well-optimized\n+ Monetization model that lets you earn everything but a very small handful of cosmetics just by playing and/or trading\n+ Crazy amounts of depth and customization\n+ Story quests introduced near late-game are incredible\n+ Combat is incredibly visceral and rewarding\n+ Tons of activities to grind away at, lots of variety to keep you occupied while earning items and materials\n+ Frequently updated, devs prioritize new content over bugfixes\n\n- Devs prioritize new content over bugfixes\n- Holy mother of grinding\n- Poor tutorials and explanations in-game along with a big learning curve: bookmark the wiki, and prepare to still learn you've been doing something wrong every day\n- Monetization model is a huge trap if you go into it looking to spend some money. Go into it free, wait for a coupon in your daily login rewards, and only spend plat on slots and reactors/catalysts. If you're too desperate to grind out a new item you really want, this game isn't for you because the grind *is* the game.\n\nOverall Warframe is a fantastic, if flawed free to play game that really carves out a niche for itself in an oversaturated F2P market. In spite of the popularity of its features and genre, there really isn't anything else out there quite like it that comes close in terms of ambition and quality. It's not for everybody and it has its issues, but it's an incredibly rich experience with so much to see and do, and if the gameplay loop clicks with you, it *really* clicks with you. Go ahead and download it and try it out, it's best started free so you have nothing to lose.", "timestamp_created": 1503514433, "timestamp_updated": 1503514433, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.490556597709655762", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}